  "Gaussian splats": "Gaussian splats", "Splats": "Splats", "How it is drawn in 3D: its Gaussians, or their centres as points": "Cum se desenează în 3D: gaussienele lui sau centrele lor ca puncte", "How a cloud of Gaussian splats is drawn in a 3D view": "Cum se desenează un nor de Gaussian splats într-o vedere 3D", "Up axis": "Axa de sus", "z (a scan)": "z (o scanare)", "y (SPZ, glTF)": "y (SPZ, glTF)", "−y (a 3DGS PLY)": "−y (un PLY 3DGS)", "Point cloud or splats (LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, SPZ, SOG, XYZ, PTS, CSV)": "Nor de puncte sau splats (LAS, LAZ, E57, PLY, SPZ, SOG, XYZ, PTS, CSV)",
